---
title: Spotify Listening Stats - Public Read Paths
---
sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	actor Visitor as Website visitor
	participant Frontend as GitHub Pages listening page
	participant Worker as Cloudflare Worker API
	participant Spotify as Spotify Web API
	participant D1 as Cloudflare D1

	Visitor->>Frontend: Open /listening/
	Frontend->>Worker: GET public stats endpoints with Origin header
	alt CORS configuration is missing or malformed
		Worker-->>Frontend: 503 SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE
	else Browser Origin is present but does not match
		Worker-->>Frontend: 403 CORS_ORIGIN_DENIED
	else Origin is allowed or absent on a non-browser request
		par Live now-playing path
			Frontend->>Worker: GET /api/spotify/now-playing
			Worker->>Spotify: Refresh access token and request currently playing
			alt Track is currently playing
				Spotify-->>Worker: Track, artwork, state, and progress
				Worker-->>Frontend: data plus meta, public max-age=15
			else Nothing is currently playing
				Spotify-->>Worker: No active item
				Worker->>D1: Query latest stored play
				D1-->>Worker: Most recent public track projection or null
				Worker-->>Frontend: Fallback data plus meta, public max-age=15
			end
		and Stored read paths
			Frontend->>Worker: GET summary, top artists, top tracks, activity, lifetime
			Worker->>D1: Aggregate queries only
			D1-->>Worker: Aggregate projections
			Worker-->>Frontend: data plus meta, public max-age=60
		and Bounded recent and archive paths
			Frontend->>Worker: GET recent?limit or archive/search?q&limit
			Worker->>D1: Bounded recent or track-name aggregate search
			D1-->>Worker: Required public fields only
			Worker-->>Frontend: data plus meta, recent max-age=30; archive max-age=60
		end
	end

	Note over Frontend,Worker: Success envelope is data plus meta; error envelope is error with code and message
	Note over Worker,D1: Errors use Cache-Control no-store
	Note over Visitor,D1: No endpoint exposes the full raw timestamped plays table
